# Atlas Re — claim handling (D2 activity, multi-branch with reopen). Regenerate: bash skills/d2-activity/render.sh atlas-re.d2
direction: right
vars: { beFill:"#E6F4EA"; secFill:"#FFE4E6"; dbFill:"#F1EAFB"; highlightFill:"#FFF4E5" }

Report: Loss reported { shape: oval; style.fill:${beFill} }
Validate: Validate coverage { shape: diamond; style.fill:${highlightFill} }
Decline: Decline claim { style.fill:${secFill} }
Create: Create claim (PRECAUTIONARY) { style.fill:${beFill} }
Register: Register claim { style.fill:${beFill} }
Investigate: Investigate { style.fill:${beFill} }
Decide: Reserve decision { shape: diamond; style.fill:${highlightFill} }
Settle: Settle and pay { style.fill:${beFill} }
Closed: Closed { shape: oval; style.fill:${beFill} }
Reopen: Reopen { style.fill:${secFill} }

Report -> Validate: reported
Validate -> Decline: not covered
Validate -> Create: covered
Create -> Register: filed
Register -> Investigate: opens
Investigate -> Decide
Decide -> Settle: approve pay
Decide -> Closed: deny
Settle -> Closed
Closed -> Reopen: new info
Reopen -> Investigate: reopens
